## Checklist Before Completing Task

- [ ] All files have `declare(strict_types=1);`
- [ ] PSR-12 compliant
- [ ] SOLID principles applied
- [ ] No business logic in Controller
- [ ] No Request access in Service/UseCase
- [ ] Dependency Injection used everywhere
- [ ] Repository Interface defined
- [ ] Custom Exceptions for business errors
- [ ] FormRequest for validation
- [ ] API Resource for response formatting
- [ ] Eager loading to prevent N+1
- [ ] Pagination for list endpoints
- [ ] Proper indexes suggested
- [ ] Transaction where needed
- [ ] Feature test provided
- [ ] Unit test provided
- [ ] cURL examples provided
- [ ] No sensitive data in logs
- [ ] Rate limiting considered
- [ ] Cache layer when appropriate
- [ ] Migration file included
- [ ] Service Provider bindings defined

